WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
The crouching timing jab misses the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.450
Held back heavy punch trades with Ryu’s recorded attack.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.350
Forward heavy kick converts after both characters take damage.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.900
OD Quadriga bounces Ryu for the back-heavy pickup.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.500
Medium Phalanx finishes the trade conversion.
